# .graphifyignore
#
# Scopes the graphify knowledge graph to the codebase, top-level project docs
# (README.md, CHANGELOG.md, etc.) and the .planning/ GSD artifacts. Uses
# gitignore syntax and is merged after .gitignore, with these patterns winning
# on conflict (last-match-wins).

# GSD planning artifacts are INDEXED (unignored 2026-08-22 on request).
# Only their non-document noise is excluded below.
.planning/**/*.json
.planning/**/*.sig
.planning/graphs/

# throwaway working files
scratchpad/

# graphify's own output, must not index itself
graphify-out/

# agent config, not project code
.claude/
